        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.82,
          "end": 192.46,
          "en": "Now, of course, this is not just about markup and styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.46,
          "end": 194.98,
          "en": "but we also need a script for some logic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.98,
          "end": 199.51,
          "en": "We want to fetch the inputs for email and message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.51,
          "end": 203.45,
          "en": "We probably want to do some kind of validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.45,
          "end": 206.4,
          "en": "It's up to you if it should be as detailed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 206.4,
          "end": 209.18,
          "en": "as on the coach registration page or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.18,
          "end": 211.04,
          "en": "but some validation won't hurt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 211.04,
          "end": 214.07999999999998,
          "en": "And ultimately once we got a valid input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.07999999999998,
          "end": 216.66,
          "en": "we want to do something with that input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 216.66,
          "end": 219.06,
          "en": "and we want to, in the end, create a new message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 219.06,
          "end": 223.04,
          "en": "which is attached to the coach to whom the message is sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 223.04,
          "end": 224.97,
          "en": "That's the idea here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.97,
          "end": 226.37,
          "en": "So therefore in this script,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 226.37,
          "end": 228.62,
          "en": "I'll start by adding some data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.62,
          "end": 231.96,
          "en": "because we definitely want to manage some data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.96,
          "end": 234.18,
          "en": "And the data we definitely want to manage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 234.18,
          "end": 237.55,
          "en": "is the email address and the message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.55,
          "end": 238.82999999999998,
          "en": "I guess that makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.82999999999998,
          "end": 241.403,
          "en": "because these are the two inputs we got here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 242.44,
          "end": 243.91,
          "en": "But in addition to that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 243.91,
          "end": 248.91,
          "en": "here I will also add a form is valid, data property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 250.46,
          "end": 252.43,
          "en": "and set it to true initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 252.43,
          "end": 254.62,
          "en": "And this should be set to false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.62,
          "end": 259.013,
          "en": "if either the email address or text area is invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 260.49,
          "end": 262.42,
          "en": "So as a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 262.42,
          "end": 266.84,
          "en": "we can add methods here to this object here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 266.84,
          "end": 269.14,
          "en": "to this component, conflict object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 269.14,
          "end": 273.13,
          "en": "and a submit form method sounds about right,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 273.13,
          "end": 275.56,
          "en": "because that's the method that should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 275.56,
          "end": 277.38,
          "en": "when the form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 277.38,
          "end": 281.26,
          "en": "And of course we can therefore add a submit event handler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 281.26,
          "end": 285.12,
          "en": "to this form and prevent the browser default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 285.12,
          "end": 287.42,
          "en": "as we did as many times before in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 287.42,
          "end": 292.313,
          "en": "and then point at submit form when this form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 294.34000000000003,
          "end": 297.8,
          "en": "So inside of submit form, I now want to validate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 297.8,
          "end": 300.07,
          "en": "and if the data is valid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 300.07,
          "end": 302.89,
          "en": "create a new message or ensured",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 302.89,
          "end": 305.73,
          "en": "that a new message is created somehow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 305.73,
          "end": 308.01,
          "en": "So let's start with validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 308.01,
          "end": 310.85,
          "en": "First of all, I'll set form is valid to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 310.85,
          "end": 313.6,
          "en": "so that if it was false in between,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 313.6,
          "end": 316.6,
          "en": "we now clear any error message we might be showing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 316.6,
          "end": 319.423,
          "en": "We're not showing one yet, but we will soon do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 320.69,
          "end": 324.4,
          "en": "So as a next step, we can then check if this email",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 324.4,
          "end": 325.993,
          "en": "is empty, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 327.06,
          "end": 329.12,
          "en": "or if this email",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 330.26,
          "end": 333.9,
          "en": "includes no at symbol.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 333.9,
          "end": 335.93,
          "en": "So here I checked for the opposite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 335.93,
          "end": 339.26,
          "en": "If it does not include an at symbol,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 339.26,
          "end": 343.15,
          "en": "or if this message is empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 343.15,
          "end": 344.94,
          "en": "If either of that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 344.94,
          "end": 349.09000000000003,
          "en": "then I want to set this form is valid to false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 349.09000000000003,
          "end": 353.193,
          "en": "and return so that the rest of this method doesn't execute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 355.24,
          "end": 357.94,
          "en": "So now that we manage this validity,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 357.94,
          "end": 360.33,
          "en": "I want to do two things in the markup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 360.33,
          "end": 364.1,
          "en": "For one, I want to bind my input and my text area",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 364.1,
          "end": 367.08,
          "en": "to email and message with two way binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 367.08,
          "end": 370.43,
          "en": "so that this is updated with every keystroke,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 370.43,
          "end": 374.49,
          "en": "and I want to show an error message if the form is invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 374.49,
          "end": 377.59,
          "en": "Now we'll start with the two way binding with V model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 377.59,
          "end": 379.97,
          "en": "I'll automatically trim the input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 379.97,
          "end": 382.55,
          "en": "and then point at email here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 382.55,
          "end": 385.91,
          "en": "and on the text area, all to trimming it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 385.91,
          "end": 387.14300000000003,
          "en": "point at message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 389.18,
          "end": 392.13,
          "en": "And then we can show an error as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 392.13,
          "end": 395.86,
          "en": "by adding a paragraph here, for example, above the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 395.86,
          "end": 398.75,
          "en": "which has a class of errors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 398.75,
          "end": 401.64,
          "en": "which should be shown with V-if",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 401.64,
          "end": 405.6,
          "en": "if forum is valid is false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 405.6,
          "end": 407.263,
          "en": "so if it's not true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 408.34000000000003,
          "end": 410.88,
          "en": "and then here you can output any message you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 410.88,
          "end": 415.88,
          "en": "I'll say, please enter a valid email and non empty message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
